WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.352
In one minute, you will change your entry, then take it out of the contest.

00:00:04.352 --> 00:00:05.392
We start on the map.

00:00:06.294 --> 00:00:08.187
Tap Places to open the list.

00:00:10.061 --> 00:00:13.394
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:15.269 --> 00:00:17.692
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:17.692 --> 00:00:20.181
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:20.181 --> 00:00:21.527
Tap Use my location.

00:00:23.453 --> 00:00:25.669
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:26.321
Tap Allow.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.936
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:34.936 --> 00:00:36.154
See the three dots?

00:00:36.154 --> 00:00:36.701
Tap them.

00:00:40.154 --> 00:00:42.116
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:43.806 --> 00:00:44.478
Tap Mine.

00:00:44.478 --> 00:00:47.301
Under Homes you entered, tap Open contest.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.350
Tap Open contest.

00:00:52.406 --> 00:00:53.363
Find Your home.

00:00:53.363 --> 00:00:55.157
Tap Edit name and description.

00:00:56.831 --> 00:00:59.084
Change the name, then tap Save.

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:04.416
To take your home out, tap Withdraw.

00:01:06.092 --> 00:01:09.869
It asks you to tap again, so you cannot do it by accident.

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:10.701
Tap it again.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.604
Next up: Your profile.
